WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:13.820
Well, women in my generation . . . there weren’t too many opportunities open for us about in ’38 and ’40 . . . A lady in the South could only do certain things.

2
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:22.340
She could teach school and she could maybe be a nurse, and a homemaker, and that was about it.

3
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:26.800
And so I decided that home economics solved both things.

4
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.960
I never really wanted to be anything but a wife and a mother,

5
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:36.540
and if I took home economics I could learn to be a better wife and mother.

6
00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:41.460
But I also . . . if I had to earn a living, I had a way to do it.

7
00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:43.700
So that’s why I chose home economics.

8
00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:46.600
Because of the age and time.

9
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.100
Now I don’t know what I would do today.
